      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170463\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170463\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The equivalent thickness of concrete masonry assemblies, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">T<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">ea<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t, shall be computed as the sum of the equivalent thickness of the concrete masonry unit, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">T<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">e<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t, as determined by Section 722.3.1.2, 722.3.1.3, or 722.3.1.4, plus the equivalent thickness of finishes, T\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">ef<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t, determined in accordance with Section 722.3.2:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170464\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170464\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">T<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">ea<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t = <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">T<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">e<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t + <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">T<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">ef<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">(Equation 7-6)<\/span>&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "15242-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "The equivalent thickness of concrete masonry assemblies, T ea \n\n , shall be computed as the sum of the equivalent thickness of the concrete masonry unit, T e \n\n , as determined by Section 722.3.1.2, 722.3.1.3, or 722.3.1.4, plus the equivalent thickness of finishes, T\n\n ef \n\n , determined in accordance with Section 722.3.2:\n\n T ea \n\n = T e \n\n + T ef (Equation 7-6)"
    }
